      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AGENT TWENTY ONE (2) scorched around Geelong over 400m in 22.43 for a 1.75 lengths victory. Can measure up again if runs up to latest time. PAW CORNELIUS (5) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (30.08) in a Grade 5 at Sandown. Solid record here winning two races. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Shapes as one to consider. PAW TIFFY (8) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Horsham over 410m behind Shallow Sally (24.49) in a Grade 5. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Can do much better this time. WESTERN'S NASIAH (4) did a good job to finish third last time out over 390m at this track (22.30) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
